      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1354838642,
      "text": "Rubus allegheniensis is a North American species of highbush blackberry. It is commonly known as Allegheny blackberry."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Rubus allegheniensis",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_allegheniensis",
